# Feedback Classifier — core

## Source of truth

Implement and change behavior in line with:

- `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-04-16-feedback-classifier-design.md`
- `docs/superpowers/plans/implementation-plan.md`

If code and spec diverge, update spec/README or fix code—do not leave silent drift.

## Precedence (skills vs this repo)

Optional **Cursor skills** installed for this project:

- **`nestjs-best-practices`** (`npx skills add https://github.com/kadajett/agent-nestjs-skills --skill nestjs-best-practices`)
- **`frontend-design`** (`npx skills add https://github.com/anthropics/skills --skill frontend-design`)

Use them for **idiomatic Nest** and **UI/visual craft** (structure, accessibility, hierarchy). **If anything conflicts** with this repo’s product spec, `docs/superpowers/`, or `.cursor/rules/`, **the repo wins**. Do not introduce Redis, queues, extra microservices, or scope not in the spec just because a skill suggests “production” patterns.

## Stack (fixed for this MVP)

- Monorepo: `apps/api` (NestJS REST), `apps/web` (React + Vite + Chakra UI).
- MongoDB via root `docker-compose.yml` only for DB; **no Redis/BullMQ** unless the spec explicitly changes.
- LLM: **OpenAI** official SDK; **no** direct OpenAI usage outside the classification/LLM module (see API rule).

## Product rules

- Ingestion classification is **synchronous** in the same HTTP request as persistence.
- On LLM failure: still **persist** `rawText` with `classificationStatus: failed` and `classificationError`; respond **201** (per spec)—never pretend success with empty labels.
- Global API prefix: **`/api`**. Validate env at bootstrap (`MONGODB_URI`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `Slack ingest secret`, `CORS_ORIGIN`).
- Slack-like ingest: shared-secret header; **idempotency** on `sourceMetadata.externalMessageId` with **sparse unique** index when implementing Mongo.

## Do not add (MVP)

CQRS/event sourcing, multi-tenant auth, real Slack OAuth, Jira integration, extra microservices, or “queue everything” patterns without an explicit spec change.
